# LOCKED CLIENTS MANAGEMENT MODULE — DO NOT MODIFY WITHOUT EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL

The Clients Management module is an approved, frozen baseline. Do not change, redesign, restyle, restyle-via-globals, add, remove, resize, or reposition anything in it unless the user explicitly requests that specific Clients Management change in the current conversation.

This lock is independent of the Login Page lock and the Dashboard lock. All three remain fully in force.

## Before editing any file below

Require an explicit user instruction that clearly asks to modify Clients Management (for example: “change the Clients KPI cards” or “update the Add Client modal”). Unrelated work, other modules, refactors, “while we’re here” polish, and inferred improvements are not approval.

## Locked files (do not edit without explicit approval)

Page, styles, and tests:

- `04_Frontend/frontend/src/pages/ClientsPage.tsx`
- `04_Frontend/frontend/src/pages/ClientsPage.test.tsx`
- `04_Frontend/frontend/src/pages/clients/clients-page.css`

